      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XLVII} Gif ðeowman wyrce on Sunnandæg be his hlafordes hæse, sie he freoh, ⁊ se hlaford geselle XXX sciƚƚ to wite</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a slave works on Sunday at his lord’s command, let him be free, and the lord must pay 30 shillings as fine.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a slave works on Sunday by his lord's command, he shall become free, and the lord shall pay a fine of 30 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif ðeowmon wyrce on Sunnondæg be his hlafordes hæse, sy he freoh, ⁊ se hlaford gesylle XXX scll' to wite</ab>
      </div>
